| name = Paralysis
| gameimage = ParalysisPanel.png
| cardimage = ParalysisModU15.jpeg
| hotkey = 3
| energy = 25
| description = Unleash a damaging blast, slowing its victims while increasing their Melee Damage Vulnerability.
| strength = 100 / 200 / 300 / 400 {{D|Impact}} damage<br>15% / 20% / 25% / 30% {{D|Slow}}<br>20% / 30% / 40% / 50% Melee [[Damage Vulnerability]]
| range = 5 / 7 / 8 / 10 m
| duration = 15s
| misc = 75% {{D|Slow}} cap
| cardonly = {{{1|}}}
| info = * Valkyr expends {{Stat|Ability Efficiency|icon=only}}'''25''' [[energy]] to release a paralyzing wave within {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''5 / 7 / 8 / 10''' meters around her, inflicting enemies within direct [[Line of Sight]] with {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''100 / 200 / 300 / 400''' {{D|Impact}} damage, {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''15% / 20% / 25% / 30%''' {{D|Slow}}, and {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''20% / 30% / 40% / 50%''' Melee [[Damage Vulnerability]] for {{Stat|Ability Duration|icon=only}}'''15''' seconds.
**Slow is capped at <u>'''75%'''</u>.
**Enemies struck are stunned for 3 seconds (unaffected by Ability Duration), which leaves them open to [[Finisher]] attacks.
***If an enemy is already affected by a similar stun (e.g. {{D|Heat||Heat's}} panic effect, {{D|Electricity|Electricity's}} stun, being {{D|Cold|Frozen}}), this effect will not trigger, and the target will not be vulnerable to Finisher attacks.
***If the enemy cannot be attacked with a Finisher (either due to positioning or the enemy type), it will be susceptible to [[Stealth#Damage_Multipliers|Stealth Damage Multipliers]] from melee attacks for the duration of the stun. As with other stealth attacks, coming into physical contact with the enemy while attacking will temporarily remove the damage bonus.
**Line of sight checks come from camera position, rather than Valkyr's position.
**Can destroy [[Objects]], which does '''not''' require line of sight.
| synergies =
* Paralysis enables Finisher attacks, which provides the biggest increase to [[Valkyr/Abilities#Passive|Rage]].
