| tips =
* The way Paralysis is treated is similar to {{WF|Banshee}}'s {{A|Sonic Boom}}, dealing a blast with tremendous knockback, but doing a full 360 angle of damage with half of the original range.
* A single use of Paralysis is typically sufficient to destroy all the fuel injectors in a [[Sabotage]] mission.
* Paralysis's ability to enable reliable Finishers synergizes well with {{Arcane|Arcane Trickery}}, allowing Valkyr to benefit from stealth attacks and {{Arcane|Arcane Crepuscular}}.
<noinclude>
|max = {{WFmax|main|valkyr3}}
</noinclude>
| bugs = *When Paralysis is used repeatably, Valkyr's accompanying scream may sometimes skip over itself and not play. This is merely an auditory bug.
*Enemies don't get opened to Finishers if they are animation-locked (e.g. under {{D|Heat|Heat's}} panic effect, {{D|Cold|Frozen}}, {{D|Electricity|Electricuted}}).
*Paralysis can slow enemies that have {{D|Overguard}}.|
